# The 2.4 million triangle test house: too big for GitHub's file limit. Remake it from its Meshy task (Docs/Roadmap.md) if needed.
Art/Buildings/*Detailed*
Content/Buildings/*Detailed*

# All library originals (filler props and animals): several GB in total. Art/Filler/Sources.md and Art/Animals/Sources.md link every page to download them again.
Art/Filler/Originals/
Art/Animals/Originals/
